  "item_short_desc": "<p>Be ready at a moment&rsquo;s notice with our V2 Concealed Carry Soft Shell Vest. This CCW vest features a waterproof 100% polyester fabric that will keep you and your EDC essentials dry while offering best-in-class discrete carry. Whether you are on-duty or out traveling, stay prepared with this soft shell vest.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": null,
  "description": "<p>Be ready at a moment&rsquo;s notice with our V2 Concealed Carry Soft Shell Vest. This CCW vest features a waterproof 100% polyester fabric that will keep you and your EDC essentials dry while offering best-in-class discrete carry. Whether you are on-duty or out traveling, stay prepared with this soft shell vest. Tackle the Great Outdoors: As part of Rothco&rsquo;s rugged Soft Shell collection, the V2 Concealed Carry Vest shields you from harsh weather. The Soft Shell Weatherproof 3-layer fabric system deflects wind, retains heat, and releases moisture. The high-performance fabric will help protect and keep you comfortable while braving the elements. CCW Pockets: The concealed carry vest features a variety of pockets, including 2 inner mag pockets and 2 strengthened flap pockets with hook &amp; loop closures for securing your firearm and CCW gear. The 2 zippered chest pockets and 2 zippered side pockets provide additional storage for essentials, like a phone, wallet, or keys. Utility at the Forefront: The front two-way zipper allows you to open the tactical concealed carry vest from both the top and bottom for quick, easy access to your items. Perfect for Layering: These outdoor vests are easy to layer under or over other clothing while allowing you to discreetly carry in comfort. Complete your wardrobe with one of our Heavyweight Flannel Shirts, Acrylic Commando Sweaters, or M-65 Field Jackets. Discreetly Carry in Confidence: Rothco stands out as the leader in concealed carry clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective CCW gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of specialized concealed carry items. From public safety and military personnel, to privately armed citizens, Rothco is the go-to brand for concealed carry apparel and gear.</p>",
